                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>A direct radiotelegraph circuit between the United States and Saudi Arabia was
                    opened on September 16. The first message it conveyed, sent by Secretary
                    Marshall to Minister Childs, is printed in Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October 3, 1948, page 449. For
                    documentation on the proposed establishment of the circuit, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1945v08/pg_1009">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1945, volume VIII, pages
                        1009</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
